=== PILOT CANTINAS, MERCENARIES & CARTOGRAPHY ===

Pilot cantinas appear at Stardock Prime (The Singing Pulsar)
and at 5% of regional starports across the galaxy.

* DRINKS & BUZZ:
  - Buying drinks raises your Buzz level by +1.0.
  - Hearing rumors costs -0.5 Buzz. Higher Buzz unlocks high-tier
    intel (Cosmic Anomalies, live Trade Routes, Free Starcharts & Mercs).
  - Danger: Buzz over 5.0 risks blackout, pickpockets, or arrest fines!
* ESCORT MERCENARIES:
  - Hire Vanguard gunships (15-jump contracts) for combat fire support.
* NAV CHARTS:
  - Buy cartography scans from wanderers to reveal distant star systems.
* DICE WAGERS: Play galactic dice for quick credit stakes.
